agent.seeder\n        scope: synthetics/fixtures/seeder.py — idempotent loader that upserts synthetic\n          candidates into Postgres on backend boot\n  - id: synthetics-scoring-agent\n    scope: Deterministic scoring drift detection via fingerprinting and diffing\n      against accepted baselines\n    branch: feat/synthetics-scoring-agent\n    blocked_by:\n      - synthetics-fixtures-agent\n    blocks: []\n    capabilities:\n      - anthropic-sdk\n      - pydantic\n      - structlog\n    sub_agents:\n      - id: synthetics-scoring-agent.runner\n        scope: backend/synthetics/scoring_runner.py — ScoringSyntheticRunner.run_suite()\n          iterates synthetic candidates × JDs\n      - id: synthetics-scoring-agent.fingerprint\n        scope: backend/synthetics/fingerprint.py — compute_fingerprint(digest, contract)\n          produces stable JSON per candidate\n      - id: synthetics-scoring-agent.diff\n        scope: backend/synthetics/diff.py — diff_against_baseline(fingerprint, baseline,\n          contract) returns DriftReport\n      - id: synthetics-scoring-agent.cli\n        scope: backend/synthetics/cli.py — python -m backend.synthetics run\n          --suite=scoring\n      - id: synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification\n        scope: backend/synthetics/scoring_runner.py — verify cache_creation_input_tokens\n          == 0 on subsequent runs\n  - id: synthetics-crawler-agent\n    scope: Upstream health monitoring with state machine alerts for consecutive\n      failures\n    branch: feat/synthetics-crawler-agent\n    blocked_by:\n      - synthetics-fixtures-agent\n    blocks: []\n    capabilities:\n      - httpx\n      - redis-pubsub\n      - structlog\n    sub_agents:\n      - id: synthetics-crawler-agent.runner\n        scope: backend/synthetics/crawler_health.py — CrawlerHealthRunner.run_suite()\n          hits known-good slugs per source\n      - id: synthetics-crawler-agent.schemas\n        scope: backend/synthetics/expected_schema_v1.json — exp